WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
For centuries, Christian prayers and
hymns have mostly used male words for God:

2
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:09.220
Father, King, Lord, and he.

3
00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:12.580
Some people say these are
just old habits of speech.

4
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.420
Others say the words shape how we see God,

5
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:17.860
and how we see men and women.

6
00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:22.610
So when Christians call God Father,
do they believe God is male?

7
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:26.480
In this mission, you'll ask what
human words for God are doing,

8
00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:28.610
and whether they can do harm.

9
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:33.860
Then you'll meet feminist thinkers who
argue that these words matter a great deal.

10
00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:38.190
Your mission: find out what Christians
mean when they call God Father.
